{title: 13 Al Dios invisible}
{key: G}
{time: 3/4}
{lyricist: Walter; C; Smith, 1867 (1824-1908); Vers. esp.: Carlos A. Steger (1953- )}
{composer: Sr; Melodía tradicional galesa}

{sov}
